WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.990
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:07.910
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:11.780
Just a little more, just a little bit more.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:16.300
Raise your hands!

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:22.910
Tokimeki Memorial

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:27.180
I'm sure you won't realize it,

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:31.110
But you're the same as you always were.

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:35.840
You smiled at me.

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:41.940
Like a leaf swaying in the wind,

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:48.790
It seems like my heart is going to explode.

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:53.630
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:56.580
"Be strong and be sad!"

00:00:57.070 --> 00:01:00.560
Just a little more, just a little bit more.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:04.480
Raise your hands!

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:09.250
Someday, you will be gentle,

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:12.350
And understand what I am saying to you!

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:16.210
It'll be all right, no matter where you go,

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:20.720
This excitement will never stop!

00:01:45.830 --> 00:01:47.370
CAT EARS!!

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:55.300
How did this happen?

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:58.590
Why me?!

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:05.730
Kamiya-san's e-mail address!

00:02:06.350 --> 00:02:08.850
There he is! Over there!

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:10.810
Hold it!

00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:17.610
Leave me alone!

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:54.980
Morning, Mina.

00:02:55.860 --> 00:02:56.860
Good morning.

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:02.450
Hey, Tsukasa!

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:03.700
Don't cut class!

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:05.530
Y-Yes!

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:07.830
CAT EARS!

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:13.460
Why is everyone chasing me?

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:15.040
Why do they have to keep chasing me?

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:18.130
It was peaceful this morning, but...

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:24.050
Oh, so you transfered here today, Aoba Riku-kun?

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:25.180
Yes.

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:26.350
Thanks for having me.

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:28.100
By the way, I'm the headmaster here-

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:29.390
Well, that's simple.

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:31.440
I'll briefly explain the details of the school.

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:37.110
This school was built quite recently, so
people don't really know much about it.

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:40.280
There are many facilities on the
campus with the latest equipment.

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:45.950
I'm proud to say that this school provides students with freedom in their school life.

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:47.620
I see.

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:51.960
Yes, we have the latest equipment at our school.

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:55.080
Oh, by the way, I'm the headmaster-

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:56.920
We have a wide curriculum here...

00:03:56.920 --> 00:04:06.100
Japanese, Mathematics, Science, Social Studies, Foreign Languages, Art, Physical Education, Home Economics.

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:09.970
You may freely choose which subjects to take.

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:12.230
I-I see.

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:14.940
That's not all.

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:17.440
Oh, I'm the head-

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:22.110
In a word, the theme of this school is: Freedom.

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:24.160
Freedom?

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:27.240
Yes! Freedom!

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:29.240
I am the head-

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:30.620
That will be all.

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:32.750
You will hear the rest from your homeroom teacher.

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:35.830
Good morning.

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:40.590
Were you surprised?

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:43.420
The headmaster's secretary is quite flashy.

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:45.130
Yes, a little.

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:48.930
She really stimulates the high school students.

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:50.180
Um...

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:51.930
Oh, I'm so sorry.

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:54.390
I haven't introduced myself yet.

00:04:54.390 --> 00:04:58.020
I'm your homeroom teacher, Wakatake Haruka.

00:04:58.020 --> 00:04:59.820
I also teach English.

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:04.490
What is this "freedom" that the secretary was talking about?

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:06.860
Oh, you'll get used to it very quickly.

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:09.160
This is your classroom.

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:10.740
"Get used to it?"

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:12.040
Don't be shy.

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:13.000
Come on, go in.

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:18.920
I'm Aoba Riku.

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:22.420
I moved to this town because of my father's business.

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:23.670
Please look after me.

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:39.560
Please look after us, too!

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:40.770
I knew it! He's so cute!

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:41.860
Do you have a girlfriend?

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:42.900
What are your hobbies?

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:45.860
Now, now. Don't flood our transfer student with questions.

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:48.610
Well, Aoba-kun... Would you mind sitting there?

00:05:48.610 --> 00:05:49.450
Not at all.

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:57.920
Okay then, Amamiya-san.

00:05:57.920 --> 00:05:59.500
Please take care of the rest.

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:00.500
Yes.

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:04.840
Hello, Aoba-kun.

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:09.220
My name is Amamiya Sayuri.

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:13.810
If you have any trouble, or if there's anything you don't understand, feel free to discuss it with me.

00:06:16.430 --> 00:06:17.600
What's wrong?

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:20.270
No, it's nothing.

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:27.280
Oh, that's right.

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:29.360
What do they mean by "Freedom of Choice"?

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:33.240
We've got science next, Riku.

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:33.950
C'mon, let's go!

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:34.290
Okay.

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:36.120
Let's go, Sayuri.

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:37.290
Yes.

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:45.750
Amamiya-san.

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:47.170
You sure are pretty.

00:06:47.460 --> 00:06:50.380
But anyway, how long do I have to hide here?

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:52.600
Transfer student Aoba Riku.

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:56.560
You look troubled.

00:06:56.560 --> 00:06:58.020
Y-You're the science teacher!

00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:00.520
Should I...

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:03.560
Should I make some medicine for you?!

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:09.860
Saliva Check!

00:07:11.070 --> 00:07:15.080
Yes... You're too stressed and excited.

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:22.500
Why are all the teachers weird?!

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:32.800
Today, we will investigate the effect of
newly-developed medicines on the human body.

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:35.640
How strong is your grip?

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:37.770
A-About 30 kilograms...

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:41.890
If you drink this medicine I invented, you'll become stronger.

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:42.810
Drink it!

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:43.850
Come on!

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:46.520
Come on! Come on! Come on! Come on! Come on!

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:46.190
Please forgive me!

00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:49.610
In other words, this novel...

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:55.910
I can't die yet!

00:07:55.910 --> 00:07:58.290
Not until I teach them about the magnificence of literature!

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:16.350
That won't do at all!

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:17.760
Listen up, all of you!

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:20.640
Are you taking this seriously?

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:24.020
But there are some good students among you.

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:25.150
Especially...

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:28.690
You! What's your name?

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:31.110
Aoba Riku.

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:32.950
Aoba-kun, is it?

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:34.490
I'll remember it.

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:47.580
What'll I do?

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:50.170
The only place left to hide is...

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:03.680
Wow! Your lunch looks great, Sayuri!

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:05.520
Did you make it yourself?

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:06.600
Yes.

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:09.820
I usually make one for my dad, so I made an extra one while I was at it.

00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:11.610
That's awesome, Mamiya-san!

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:13.860
You made such a wonderful fried egg!

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:15.450
How did you cook it?

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:19.240
It's better if you roll it before heating it gently.

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:23.370
Wow! Rabbit ears!

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:28.960
Wanna go to the canteen today?

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:29.880
Yeah!

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:33.210
What's going on?

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:35.170
Are those things popular here?

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:36.260
Yo!

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:49.730
You must've been hungry.

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:51.480
Come on. Have some more.

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:52.940
Aoba!

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:54.490
So that's where you were.

00:09:55.240 --> 00:09:57.360
We've been looking for you, Riku-kun.

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:59.360
Oh, who are you?

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:01.370
I'm Suzuki Itta.

00:10:01.370 --> 00:10:03.120
Call me Icchii.

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:05.370
I'm Kayama Yuusuke.

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:07.080
People call me Yuusuke.

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:09.460
We're in your class, but...

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:10.880
I guess you don't remember us yet.

00:10:10.880 --> 00:10:12.340
Oh, sorry.

00:10:12.340 --> 00:10:14.960
You just transferred here, right?

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:18.340
Please be friends with us.

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:19.340
Thanks.

00:10:19.890 --> 00:10:22.640
So? What do you think about this school?

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:24.390
Do you have any questions?

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:25.640
Yeah.

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:27.980
Oh, those?

00:10:27.980 --> 00:10:29.390
They're accessories.

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:33.690
We get them when we get good marks or do well in sports.

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:36.440
People who wear rare ones are popular.

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:40.660
If there's a girl you're interested in, tell me!

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:44.910
There are many girls with high standards here.

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:48.410
Tell me if you're interested in any of them.

00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:51.000
We've already collected lots of information on them.

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:52.840
Information?

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:57.630
His hobby is organizing a database of all the girls here.

00:10:57.920 --> 00:11:02.260
Their birthdays, family members, e-mail addresses, and mobile numbers.

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:03.970
He's got 'em all!

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:06.060
Well...

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:10.060
I'm interested in Amamiya-san...

00:11:10.390 --> 00:11:11.560
No kidding!

00:11:11.560 --> 00:11:13.230
Of course you'd be interested in her!

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:14.860
Amamiya Sayuri.

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:17.280
Excellent grades, good looks, she's way out of your league.

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:22.320
She's good at looking after people, she's cheerful, and she's kind to everyone.

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:24.870
There are some fan clubs at school dedicated to her.

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:26.620
She's so popular!

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:30.210
There are many legends about her!

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:31.290
Legends?

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:35.170
It happened during our entrance ceremony.

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:38.130
It was very cloudy, and it looked as though it was about to rain.

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:40.420
As soon as Amamiya-san arrived at school,

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:44.850
the skies cleared up as though heaven celebrated her arrival!

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:47.350
Half of them are made up, though.

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:50.430
Because of her beauty, even I couldn't ask her for her e-mail address.

00:11:50.430 --> 00:11:55.270
Only Ayame and the student council know her e-mail address, right?

00:11:55.270 --> 00:11:56.860
Are you the transfer student?

00:11:58.190 --> 00:11:59.070
Yes.

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:03.700
We should welcome our transfer student.

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:08.200
How about this?

00:12:10.870 --> 00:12:12.920
"How about this?!"

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:16.790
That guy... and this school...

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:18.250
Oh! There he is!

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:21.970
What's going on?!

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:26.470
I'm Tsukasa.

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:27.510
I'm Sayuri.

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:28.680
I'm Mina.

00:12:30.970 --> 00:12:34.100
Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love!

00:12:37.730 --> 00:12:38.480
All right!

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:43.280
All right!

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:46.740
Where are the Cat Ears?!

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:47.780
What?

00:12:52.830 --> 00:12:55.210
"Go to Amamiya-san?"

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:56.960
How did this happen?

00:12:58.130 --> 00:12:59.090
I know!

00:12:59.090 --> 00:12:59.960
It's all because of these!

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:04.420
Because of him, everyone's after me!

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:12.810
Okay, that's all for today's class.

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:15.190
Can you come to the library with me, Sayuri?

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:16.520
Sure, no problem.

00:13:17.850 --> 00:13:19.730
Is Aoba-kun here?

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:20.650
Is he here?

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:22.400
Yes...

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:23.400
I'm here.

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:26.530
The student council president has asked to see you.

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:29.570
Please come with us to the student council room.

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:32.830
What? But I haven't done any-

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:32.870
Hurry!

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:34.500
The president is waiting for you.

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:35.080
But...

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:40.790
I'm sorry for bringing you here so suddenly.

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:42.840
Oh, that's all right.

00:13:43.210 --> 00:13:47.260
I'm the student council president, Sakurai Haru.

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:48.140
Nice to meet you.

00:13:48.470 --> 00:13:49.890
I'm Aoba Riku.

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:56.060
This is a little present to you from us at the student council.

00:13:56.060 --> 00:13:57.600
Please accept it.

00:13:57.850 --> 00:14:01.480
It's a rare piece from my collection.

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:06.780
If you wear this, you will be popular with the whole class - no - the whole school!

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:07.610
I see.

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:10.950
By the way, you have a mobile phone, right?

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:16.710
Please be sure to contact the student
council and tell me your e-mail address.

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:17.660
Yes...

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:20.380
Huh? Um...

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:23.050
Okay, all done!

00:14:23.050 --> 00:14:24.500
Now do your best!

00:14:25.550 --> 00:14:26.880
Don't take it off!

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:31.760
From now on, you're the most popular student at this school.

00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:37.310
Wow, he wasn't kidding.

00:14:37.310 --> 00:14:39.020
Everyone's looking at me.

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:49.700
Can you come to the library with me, Sayuri?

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:50.530
Sure, no problem.

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:03.250
Just a little higher...

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:10.470
Here. Is this what you wanted?

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:17.470
Thank you so much.

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:19.060
Is that a book about dolphins?

00:15:19.060 --> 00:15:20.230
Do you like them?

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:21.770
Yes.

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:26.980
Once in a dream, I saw dolphins in the ocean.

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:27.860
Oh...

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:29.780
Is that strange?

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:32.820
No, I think that's a lovely dream.

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:34.030
I'm glad.

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:39.120
What's with all these messages?

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:40.580
From the Student Council office?

00:15:40.580 --> 00:15:43.790
"We will be holding a welcome party for our transfer student?"

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:48.880
<i>Today, we will be holding a welcoming party for our transfer student Aoba Riku!</i>

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:50.300
<i>It's coming soon!</i>

00:15:51.050 --> 00:16:00.270
The first student who catches the one with pink Cat Ears will receive Amamiya-kun's e-mail address, known only to the student council!

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:09.990
<i>If no one catches Aoba-kun, and Aoba-kun can deliver the Cat Ears to Amamiya-kun, I will tell Aoba-kun her e-mail address!</i>

00:16:09.990 --> 00:16:11.360
Hey, is this for real?

00:16:11.360 --> 00:16:12.820
I'm in!

00:16:12.820 --> 00:16:13.950
Me too!

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:15.490
Look out!

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:19.290
Geez. What a rowdy school.

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:27.460
"Well then, good luck?"

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:28.500
Um, well...

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:29.340
Huh?

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:37.350
We found you!

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:42.810
Wait!! CAT EARS!!!

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:46.810
So he's Aoba-san...

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:50.320
I see.

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:05.290
It's become quite a problem.

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:07.380
Our transfer student's in big trouble.

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:10.250
Oh, Sakurai-kun.

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:17.760
Good!

00:17:17.760 --> 00:17:19.640
The welcoming party is a huge success!

00:17:57.220 --> 00:18:00.430
LEAVE ME ALONE!!!

00:18:00.430 --> 00:18:02.350
CAT EARS!!!

00:18:02.560 --> 00:18:04.140
There he is!

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:14.820
That was a rough day.

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:17.570
Cat ears...

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:20.660
Amamiya-san's e-mail address...

00:18:21.830 --> 00:18:24.830
Today's event was so extreme.

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:30.380
Geez! What'll I do?

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:34.550
He said that the event's over if I give these to Amamiya-san, but still...

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:37.300
So you're here, Transfer Student.

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:40.220
Y-You're...

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:41.470
You sit next to me...

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:44.390
I have nothing against you.

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:46.020
But...

00:18:46.020 --> 00:18:48.980
Amamiya's a different story!

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:50.060
I'm sorry!

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:52.480
I-I-I don't know what you're talking about.

00:18:52.650 --> 00:18:58.150
Give me those pink cat ears!

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:09.160
This...

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:10.920
Did you... save me?

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:21.510
Thank you, Hiyoko-kun!

00:19:21.970 --> 00:19:24.140
I'll bring some bread for you again.

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:27.770
Okay!

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:31.980
Doujima... was beaten!

00:19:35.440 --> 00:19:36.690
No way!

00:19:36.690 --> 00:19:38.860
Is the transfer student that strong?

00:19:43.780 --> 00:19:45.780
You're pretty good, Transfer Student-kun.

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:47.290
He still hasn't been caught.

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:50.080
But at this rate...

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:51.080
I know.

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:55.590
It's almost time to go home, so we should end this event.

00:20:16.150 --> 00:20:17.980
I can't go on!

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:20.280
Just do whatever you want!

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:36.750
Aoba-kun.

00:20:36.750 --> 00:20:37.790
Are you all right?

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:00.530
It must've been hard.

00:21:01.230 --> 00:21:03.610
You got involved in Sakurai-kun's event.

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:06.610
Amamiya-san.

00:21:08.120 --> 00:21:10.450
I think that many things will happen from here on out,

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:14.250
but let's get along with each other as classmates.

00:21:16.330 --> 00:21:17.460
Yes!

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:20.710
Congratulations, Aoba-kun!

00:21:21.090 --> 00:21:22.460
You win!

00:21:23.470 --> 00:21:26.300
Man, today's event was a huge success!

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:27.720
Come on, Amamiya-kun.

00:21:27.720 --> 00:21:30.180
Please tell Aoba-kun your e-mail address.

00:21:31.600 --> 00:21:32.560
Why?

00:21:34.680 --> 00:21:40.060
You just decided to make that the prize without
asking me, so I'm under no obligation to tell him.

00:21:44.650 --> 00:21:48.820
Well, I hope you understand our school's policy now.

00:21:49.490 --> 00:21:50.200
Oh.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:51.740
Well then, please excuse me.

00:21:51.740 --> 00:21:54.040
Sakurai-san!

00:21:56.660 --> 00:21:59.670
You made Amamiya-san angry, didn't you?

00:21:59.670 --> 00:22:01.340
That is UNFORGIVABLE!

00:22:01.630 --> 00:22:04.510
No, I was just trying to make the event more exciting!

00:22:04.510 --> 00:22:06.010
NO EXCUSES!

00:22:09.050 --> 00:22:10.430
Forgive me!

00:22:11.810 --> 00:22:17.270
Will I be able to survive at this school?

00:22:32.010 --> 00:22:36.570
As the morning sunlight streams through

00:22:37.090 --> 00:22:41.770
I immediately start to think of you.

00:22:43.480 --> 00:22:48.160
The moment our eyes first met

00:22:48.710 --> 00:22:53.940
This love began.

00:22:55.270 --> 00:22:59.890
This light illuminates our future

00:23:00.370 --> 00:23:06.330
Because you're my destined one.

00:23:06.910 --> 00:23:11.840
I start to smile.

00:23:12.360 --> 00:23:16.890
This very feeling, I've been searching for it all along.

00:23:18.560 --> 00:23:23.990
I have grasped this piece of a miracle which fell into this world.

00:23:24.350 --> 00:23:29.750
I will run to your side, my love!

00:23:30.200 --> 00:23:35.350
The two of us can overcome any obstacle, no matter how high.

00:23:35.630 --> 00:23:42.120
Even though our love is still young, it's my treasure!

00:23:50.900 --> 00:23:51.910
Hey, hey!

00:23:51.910 --> 00:23:53.410
Do you believe in fate?

00:23:53.410 --> 00:23:54.780
You're too excited, Tsukasa.

00:23:54.780 --> 00:23:55.660
It's spring, after all.

00:23:55.660 --> 00:23:57.740
I finally met him!

00:23:57.740 --> 00:23:58.870
The man of fate!

00:23:58.870 --> 00:24:00.120
What are you talking about?

00:24:00.120 --> 00:24:01.040
It's spring, after all.

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:02.580
What'll I do?

00:24:02.580 --> 00:24:04.750
It's like my life is filled with roses!

00:24:04.750 --> 00:24:07.050
There's also a flower garden inside your head, because it's spring.

00:24:07.050 --> 00:24:10.720
Oh, geez! I'm so happy that it scares me!!

00:24:11.510 --> 00:24:17.220
Next on Tokimeki Memorial Only Love:

00:24:17.220 --> 00:24:19.970
An Exciting Destiny.

00:24:19.970 --> 00:24:21.460
Please watch it!

00:24:21.460 --> 00:24:24.240
I'm scared of spring.
